<p>You fire a disabling shot at a target's throat (or equivalent), dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">66%, 77%, 86%, 93%, 100%</acronym> weapon damage and silencing them for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 3, 3, 4, 5</acronym> turns.</p><p>If the target is marked, you consume the mark to fire two secondary shots at their arms and legs (or other appendages) dealing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 19%, 21%, 23%, 25%</acronym> damage, reducing their movement speed by 50% and disarming them for the duration.</p><p>The status chance increases with your Accuracy.</p>